This Watch Strap is made of the most qualitative part of the leather. These full grain cognac and navy leather are Italian hides from the Badalassi Carlo Tannery.

It has a white thread and a cognac color is used for the accent colour on the thread, inner part, and one of the buckles. It has a quick release bar but can be adapted to iWatch hardware too.

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

